ly think because you  know as I say the campaign hasn't even  started yet  just finally just looking at some of  these faces here it's more women than  men and actually more women potentially  ending entering the contest as well  you've previously said that it's  embarrassing that the Labor Party's  never had a female leader would it be  embarrassing if in a contest where war  more female candidates are standing the  mail that they runs up with another male  leader look let's make sure that we get  the best candidate I mean obviously  that's got to be that's got to be the  most important thing and it'll be for  the members to decide but I think that  the best candidate happens to be a woman  but let's see what they say okay thank  you very much for coming over  welcome to speak thank you
 

